OL,3,GNEWSAWe cannot keep our council tax    
OL,4,Apledge, say Reform                     
OL,6,FThe Reform UK leader of Barnsley       
OL,7,FCouncil has said his party cannot keep 
OL,8,Fits election pledge to freeze council  
OL,9,Ftax.                                   
OL,11,FReform took control of Barnsley Council
OL,12,Fin May by winning 41 of the 63 seats,  
OL,13,Fbringing to an end 50 years of Labour  
OL,14,Fleadership.                            
OL,16,FDuring their campaign they distributed 
OL,17,Fleaflets promising not to increase     
OL,18,Fcouncil tax, but, in an interview with 
OL,19,FBBC Radio Sheffield, William Brown     
OL,20,Fsaid, after reviewing the situation,   
OL,21,Fsticking to the promise was "not       
OL,22,Fpossible".                             
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
